{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter Visits Vanessa at Work"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Late Night"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 7}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.2"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. "}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. "}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Asking and Giving Advice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "There are several ways to ask for help in English. You can use polite and casual language to do this. Let's look at one particular structure for asking for help."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You can use the structure:<br/>Can/Could + you + show/tell + me + Question word"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Can you show me how to make lasagna?<br/>Could you show me where the washrooms are?<br/>Could you tell me what is on the dessert menu?</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "To give advice, you can use the structure:<br/>Let me show/tell + you + question word"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"italic\">Let me show you where it is.<br/>Let me tell you what you should do.</span>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could you explain to me what the problem is?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Could you tell me where that club is?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Phrasal Verbs"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "A phrasal verb is a phrase formed with a verb + preposition. <br/><br/>The combination of the verb and preposition changes the meaning of the verb."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Here are some phrasal verbs related to social activities:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "to get along -- to have a good relationship with a person<br/>to ask out -- to invite a person to an activity with a romantic intention<br/>to go out -- to leave the house, to go to a place or places in the town or city<br/>to try out -- to experiment with something new<br/>to check out -- to experience something new<br/>to come out -- to join other people to a social activity or event<br/>to cheer up -- to feel better (mood or humor)<br/>to dress up -- to put on nice clothes"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You conjugate phrasal verbs in the same way you conjugate other verbs."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Question Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I go out on Saturdays.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you go out on Saturdays?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<Present tense class=\\\"italic\\\">Present tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I am going out this evening.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Are you going out this evening?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I went out last Saturday.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Did you go out last Saturday?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have gone out every Saturday this month. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Have you gone out every Saturday this month?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect tense\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "I asked Margaret out on a date. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "We went out until about 2:00 a.m."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Do you have to dress up to go there?"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to ask out"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to invite a person to an activity with a romantic intention (such as a date)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I asked Margaret out on a date.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le07ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about social outings."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to cheer up"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to feel better in your mood, humor"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I'm sure that would cheer you up! "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le07ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be supervised"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be observed and evaluated by your boss"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I don't need to be supervised like that."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le07ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "controlling"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "wanting to control everything"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My boss is very controlling."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le07ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to be set in your ways"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to be inflexible, not willing to compromise or listen"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  She seems pretty set in her ways."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le07ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "it would be a good idea"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "it is advisable, recommended"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: She's your boss, so it would be a good idea to listen to her."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn7le07ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn7le07ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, discuss different things you can do in the evening where you live, such as seeing live music, going to a play, etc."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write an article for a blog or a newspaper telling people what they can do in the evening. This is called a \u201cNight on the Town\u201d column."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Give at least 5 suggestions of activities."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write details such as the location, hours and price of each activity. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say what is advisable.  Use <span class=\"italic\">\u201cYou ought to ...\u201d</span> or <span class=\"italic\">\u201cIt would be a good idea to ...\u201d</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your article."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read your article to a partner."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about things to do in the evening."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write suggestions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I say what is advisable."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read the paragraph to a partner."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"exercises": [{"questions": [], "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can talk about social activities."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can ask for help or advice."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": "I can write  about what is advisable."}, {"type":