woman named Vanessa.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: Could you explain to me what the problem is? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>: Yes, she's very controlling. She is always watching what I do and telling me how to do things differently.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn7le07ob09re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "24000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: Well, she's your boss, so it would be a good idea to listen to her. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>: I understand, but I don't need to be supervised like that. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: You ought to have a conversation with her. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>: She seems pretty set in her ways. What did you do last night?", "id": 2, "image": "engenn7le07ob09re2img02.jpg"}, {"time": "42000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: I asked Margaret out on a date.  We had a pretty late night. We went out until about 2:00 a.m. We tried out a new club called Angelo's. They had some live music playing. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>:  That's so cool! Could you tell me where that club is? I'd like to check it out. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: It's on the corner of Sandals and John street.  You ought to come out with us next time. I'm sure that would cheer you up!  <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>:  I would love to!  Do you have to dress up to go there? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Frank</span>: No, that's not necessary. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Julia</span>:  Perfect!  I'm in.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn7le07ob09re2img03.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob09re2img02.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "id": 0}]}